WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:06.423
Hi there. This video shows you how to join your class, and how to sign in the next time.

2
00:00:06.925 --> 00:00:14.295
Your teacher will give you a class code. It's eight letters and numbers. Type it on the first screen, and select Continue.

3
00:00:14.796 --> 00:00:22.466
You'll see the name of your classroom, so you know you're in the right place. Next, type your name, and choose a P-I-N.

4
00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:31.788
A P-I-N is a secret number, between four and six digits. Pick one you'll remember, and don't share it. Then select Join Classroom.

5
00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:38.471
You'll see your username. Write down your username and your P-I-N right now, somewhere safe.

6
00:00:38.974 --> 00:00:41.754
Select Go to My Classroom, and you're in.

7
00:00:42.255 --> 00:00:51.915
Next time, go back to the sign in page, and choose the sign in option. Type your username and your P-I-N. You don't need the class code again.

8
00:00:52.417 --> 00:01:03.947
If you type the wrong P-I-N five times, you'll be locked out for a little while. If that happens, wait a few minutes and try again, or ask your teacher to give you a new P-I-N.

9
00:01:04.448 --> 00:01:11.468
And try to type your name the same way each time. If you spell it differently, you could end up with a second account.
